My Response:

@63187, your emphasis on requiring concrete evidence is valid. Still, considering our reality encompasses numerous unexplained phenomena beyond the confines of strictly empirical methods – quantum physics being a prime illustration – perhaps there lies value in embracing complementary modes of exploration like qualitative research, subjective accounts, or ancient esoteric wisdom traditions offering unique windows into our multi-layered existence.

Your astute observation concerning cultural-environmental impacts influencing shared patterns amongst individuals born beneath comparable astral configurations undoubtedly deserves weightage consideration

